{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Host RAM pressure for the genai host (Ryzen 9 7940HS + Radeon 780M iGPU). Key insight: the effective RAM pool is ~15 GiB, not 31 GiB \u2014 16 GiB is the iGPU UMA carve-out, invisible to standard accounting. The at-a-glance row answers 'are we under pressure right now?' in under 5 seconds. Metric names verified against the live otel-collector (v0.158.0). PSI is phase 2 (see the collapsed row).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Memory pressure \u2014 at a glance",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "MemAvailable \u2014 the kernel's estimate of RAM available for new workloads without swapping (counts reclaimable cache). Green > 4 GiB, amber 2\u20134 GiB, red < 2 GiB.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "amber",
                "value": 2147483648
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 4294967296
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "system_linux_memory_available_bytes",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Effective headroom",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "(total RAM used \u2212 iGPU carve-out) as a % of the effective pool (total \u2212 carve-out). The host has ~15 GiB usable, not 31 GiB \u2014 the 16 GiB iGPU UMA carve-out is reserved. Adjust total/carve-out via the variables top-right.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "amber",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(system_memory_usage_bytes{state=\"used\"} - ${carveout_gib} * 1024^3) / ((${total_gib} - ${carveout_gib}) * 1024^3) * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "RAM budget used",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Swap in use as a % of the 8 GiB swap file. Red when non-trivial \u2014 any sustained swap use on this host is a warning sign.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "amber",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(system_paging_usage_bytes{state=\"used\"}) / (8 * 1024^3) * 100",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Swap in use",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Swap in+out page operations per second (5m rate). Sustained activity = thrashing. NOTE: the hostmetrics v0.158.0 paging scraper exposes page operations, not bytes (system.paging.bytes is absent), so this is ops/s, not MB/s.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "amber",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(system_paging_operations_total{direction=\"page_in\"}[5m])) + sum(rate(system_paging_operations_total{direction=\"page_out\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Swap activity",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Largest container by current memory (docker_stats). The two llama servers are the dominant consumers on this host.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(1, container_memory_usage_total_bytes)",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{container_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top RAM consumer",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Trends",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Host RAM: used, MemAvailable (headroom), and cached. The flat line marks the effective pool (total \u2212 iGPU carve-out \u2248 15 GiB) \u2014 the real budget, not the misleading 31 GiB total.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "effective pool"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "dash": [
                    8,
                    8
                  ],
                  "fill": "dash"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "system_memory_usage_bytes{state=\"used\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "used"
        },
        {
          "expr": "system_linux_memory_available_bytes",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "available (MemAvailable)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "system_memory_usage_bytes{state=\"cached\"}",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "cached"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(${total_gib} - ${carveout_gib}) * 1024^3",
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "effective pool"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Host memory (used / available / cached)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Swap file usage over time (device /swap.img, 8 GiB).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 8589934592,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(system_paging_usage_bytes{state=\"used\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "swap used"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(system_paging_usage_bytes{state=\"free\"})",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "swap free"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Swap usage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Swap page-in / page-out operations per second (5m rate). Sustained non-zero activity indicates thrashing. (Page operations \u2014 the bytes metric is not exposed by hostmetrics v0.158.0.)",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(system_paging_operations_total{direction=\"page_in\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "page in (ops/s)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(system_paging_operations_total{direction=\"page_out\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "page out (ops/s)"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Swap I/O",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Per-container RAM (docker_stats) for the three main consumers: the two llama servers and hindsight.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "container_memory_usage_total_bytes{container_name=~\"llamacpp-egpu|llamacpp-igpu|hindsight\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "{{container_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Per-container memory (egpu / igpu / hindsight)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "The iGPU's true memory footprint = its cgroup RAM + the iGPU VRAM (amdgpu sysfs). The cgroup alone under-reports, because the iGPU's UMA VRAM is charged to the GPU, not the container cgroup. The gap between the 'cgroup RAM' and 'combined footprint' lines is the under-reporting.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "combined footprint"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "id": 12,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "container_memory_usage_total_bytes{container_name=\"llamacpp-igpu\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "igpu cgroup RAM"
        },
        {
          "expr": "amdgpu_vram_used_bytes{gpu=\"igpu\"}",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "iGPU VRAM (amdgpu)"
        },
        {
          "expr": "container_memory_usage_total_bytes{container_name=\"llamacpp-igpu\"} + amdgpu_vram_used_bytes{gpu=\"igpu\"}",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "legendFormat": "combined footprint"
        }
      ],
      "title": "iGPU true footprint (cgroup + iGPU VRAM)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38
      },
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Memory pressure (PSI) \u2014 phase 2",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": [
        {
          "datasource": null,
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 5,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 39
          },
          "id": 14,
          "mode": "markdown",
          "options": {
            "codeHighlightLanguage": "python",
            "content": "**Phase 2 \u2014 PSI (Pressure Stall Information) is not yet available.**\n\nPSI (`/proc/pressure/memory`) reports the fraction of time tasks stalled waiting on memory \u2014 the most direct 'are we under memory pressure?' signal. It is **not** exposed by the hostmetrics receiver in this collector build, so no panel can query it yet.\n\nTo add it (phase 2): enable node_exporter's `pressure_stat` collector, **or** write a small custom OTel receiver that reads `/proc/pressure/memory` and emits `memory_pressure_stalled_ratio` (some/full). Then add a stat/timeseries panel here.\n\nUntil then, the at-a-glance row above (headroom + swap activity) is the pressure proxy.",
            "showBorder": true
          },
          "title": "PSI \u2014 phase 2 (custom receiver / node_exporter pressure_stat)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": [
    "genai",
    "ram",
    "memory",
    "pressure",
    "observability"
  ],
